  itemDescription: "Bioengineering Institute  A smart capsule to regulate daily medication
    doses  The Bioengineering Institute applies engineering principles to biology
    and medicine. Its focus includes developing biomedical devices, tissue engineering,
    and biotech solutions for healthcare. Research areas span prosthetics and assistive
    devices, biomaterials for implants, controlled drug delivery systems, and synthetic
    biology. The institute\u2019s mission is to create innovative technologies (from
    smart prosthetic limbs to organ-on-chip systems) that improve patient care and
    quality of life, often bridging the gap between lab discoveries and clinical
    applications"
